{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Imam Jafar al-Sadiq (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to Imam Ja’far ibn Muhammad al-Sadiq (a.s.):\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah; the All-beneficent, the All-mereiful.\nيَا خَالِقَ الْخَلْقِ وَ يَا بَاسِطَ الرِّزْقِ \nYAA KHAALEQAL KHALQE WA YAA BAASETAR RIZQE\nO Creator of the creation! O Amplifying of sustenance!\nوَ يَا فَالِقَ الْحَبِّ وَ يَا بَارِءَ النَّسَمِ \nWA YAA FAALEQAL HABBE WA YAA BAARE-AN NASAME\nO Splitter of grains! O Originator of spirits!\nوَ مُحْيِيَ الْمَوْتٰى وَ مُمِيْتَ الْاَحْيَاۤءِ \nWA MOHYEYAL MAWTAA WA MOMEETAL AHYAAA-E\nO Reviver of the dead! O Deadener of the living! \nوَ دَاۤئِمَ الثَّبَاتِ وَ مُخْرِجَ النَّبَاتِ \nWA DAA-EMAS SABAATE WA MUKHREJAN NABAATE\nO constantly Firm! O Bringer forth of plants! \nاِفْعَلْ بِىْ مَاۤ اَنْتَ اَهْلُهٗ \nIF-A’L BEE MAA ANTA AHLOHU\nDo to me what befits You to do, \nوَ لَا تَفْعَلْ بِىْ مَا اَنَا اَهْلُهٗ \nWA LAA TAF-A’L BEE MAA ANA AHLOHU\nbut do not do to me what I deserve, \nوَ اَنْتَ اَهْلُ التَّقْوٰى وَ اَهْلُ الْمَغْفِرَةِ.\nWA ANTA AHLUT TAQWAA WA AHLUL MAGHFERATE.\nfor You are the worthiest to be feared and the worthiest to forgive."
}
